{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12802","headline":"送别郑明府 · 韩翃","name":"送别郑明府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长头大鼻鬓如雪，早岁连兵劒锋折。\n千金尽去无斗储，双袖破来空百结。\n独恋郊扉已十春，高阳酒徒连此身。\n路傍谁识郑公子，谷口应知汉逸人。\n儿女相悲探井臼，前功岂在他人後。\n劝君不得学渊明，且策驴车辞五柳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩翃","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12802.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12802","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}